// Tier W2: unary `-` requires a signed type; an unsigned fixed-width value has no negation (it would
// silently wrap, hiding a likely bug), so negating a `u8` binding is E0044. (The literal form `-1u8`
// is caught the same way in W1; this is the variable/expression form.)
// expect: error E0044 at 7:6
// expect: exit 1
x: u8 = 5
echo -x
